16
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:53,510
Oh, that is silly.

17
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:55,840
I'll go up there. I'll tell him to keep it down.

18
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:57,930
- All right, be my guest.     - Good luck.

19
00:00:58,090 --> 00:00:59,600
All right, all right, all right.

20
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:02,180
